<template>
    <heading>DOM declarations</heading>
    <keywords>
        <li>HTML</li>
        <li>navigation</li>
        <li>toolbar</li>
        <li>Table of Contents</li>
        <li>source</li>
        <li>output</li>
        <li>status</li>
    </keywords>
    <section data-lp5-kind="explanation">
        <p>These stable pane IDs give the view destinations for navigation, article source, and expanded code. Keeping each pane's scroll container separate lets a reader inspect an expansion without losing their place in the source. The splitters are layout hooks; dragging and the toolbar actions still need behavior in this rewrite.</p>
    </section>
    <section data-lp5-kind="code">
        <name>DOM declarations</name>
        <code><![CDATA[<header id="LP5-TopNav">
    <div role="toolbar" aria-label="Main commands">
        <span>LP5</span>
        <button type="button">Reload</button>
        <button type="button">Export</button>
    </div>
</header>
<main id="LP5-Main">
    <nav id="LP5-Toc" aria-label="Table of contents"></nav>
    <div class="LP5-PaneSplitter" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical"></div>
    <section id="LP5-Source" aria-label="Source"></section>
    <div class="LP5-PaneSplitter" role="separator" aria-orientation="vertical"></div>
    <section id="LP5-Output" aria-label="Output"></section>
</main>
<div id="LP5-Status" role="status">Ready</div>
]]></code>
    </section>
</template>
